[14.878105, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[36mAutopilot — Acme\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[90mInvestigate urgent work items  \u001b[39mon\r\n  \u001b[90mFix confident hypotheses       \u001b[39mon\r\n  \u001b[90mFixes merge without a person   \u001b[39moff\r\n  \u001b[90mFixes a day                    \u001b[39m3\r\n  \u001b[90mBuild the week's line          \u001b[39mon\r\n  \u001b[90mProject for the line           \u001b[39mPayments (payments)\r\n\r\n\u001b[34mi 2026-10-05T07:21:59.382Z  investigated PAY-1 · fixed PAY-1 · built Dark mode\u001b[39m\r\n"]
